+++ b/releasenotes/notes/enabled-false-direct-call-3e7b9a1c5d2f8046.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+---
+fixes:
+  - |
+    Calling a ``Retrying`` or ``AsyncRetrying`` object directly with a function
+    now honours ``enabled=False``: the function is called exactly once and its
+    exception propagates unchanged, instead of being retried and wrapped in
+    ``RetryError``. This matches the ``@retry`` decorator and the iterator
+    interface.
